sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 👤 user
    participant H as 🖥️ host
    participant P as 🧩 plugin
    participant M as 🤖 model
    H->>P: session_start (startup)
    P-->>H: section lean = the ruleset at the level
    U->>H: a ticket
    H->>P: user_prompt
    P-->>H: prefix [lean-agent: full]
    H->>M: one system message and the ticket
    Note over H: the context grows past its budget
    H->>H: compact: plugin sections dropped
    H->>P: session_start (compact)
    P-->>H: section lean, again
    H->>P: subagent_start (explorer)
    P-->>H: section lean = the compact copy
